      "excerpt_preview": "The Rani of Jhansi Regiment performed nursing work but did not see combat.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "30ff9d46-61c1-41da-b6ba-d47c22d9a2a1",
      "locator": "3,000-strong Indian Legion",
      "text_sha256": "a80b929e5602994519d95f6fae755746419da6be16084c84f0cd89d40a503cfb",
      "excerpt_preview": "Bose established a 3,000-strong Indian Legion in Europe with Nazi German cooperation.",
      "excerpt_truncated": false,
      "screen_only": true
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "8a829f27-7532-4c71-aafe-18379e6a33a1",
      "locator": "civilian volunteers",
      "text_sha256": "e326e656d7943ada9df7b353f3eb04e0a45c7ac7d5a36bb0f093420b61218807",
      "excerpt_preview": "he INA initially formed from former British Indian Army personnel captured by Japanese forces in late 1941 and early 1942, then incorporated civilian volunteers.",
